-* use rd-font-lock-keywords after defvar it.
-* insert-buffer is for interactive use only.
-* inser-string is obsolete since emacs 22.1.
+* rd-font-lock-keywords is used inside rd-mode before it is defvar-ed,
+  so the byte-compiler warns and the value is void at the first call.
+  Move the mode definition after the keyword list.
+* insert-buffer is for interactive use only; use insert-buffer-substring.
 
